# Environment Variables Configuration

Copy this file to `.env` in the root (or `backend/` directory depending on your runner script) and fill in the appropriate values.

```env
# ============================================================
# General Application Settings
# ============================================================
APP_NAME="Knowledge Factory"
APP_VERSION="0.1.0"
DEBUG=True
# Comma-separated list of allowed frontend origins
CORS_ORIGINS="http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000"

# ============================================================
# Database Configuration
# ============================================================
# SQLite (Local Dev)
DATABASE_URL="sqlite+aiosqlite:///./knowledge_factory.db"
# PostgreSQL (Production example)
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql+asyncpg://user:password@localhost:5432/knowledge_factory"
DB_POOL_SIZE=5
DB_MAX_OVERFLOW=10
DB_ECHO=False

# ============================================================
# Security & JWT Tokens
# ============================================================
JWT_SECRET_KEY="your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-in-production"
JWT_ACCESS_TTL_MINUTES=60
JWT_REFRESH_TTL_DAYS=7
PROCTORING_JWT_SECRET="dev-proctoring-secret-stable"

# ============================================================
# AI Service Integration (Question Generation)
# ============================================================
AI_API_URL="https://api.openrouter.ai/v1/chat/completions"
AI_API_KEY="your-openrouter-api-key"
AI_MODEL="qwen/qwen-2.5-coder-32b-instruct"

# ============================================================
# Code Execution Engine (Piston)
# ============================================================
# If running locally via Docker: http://localhost:2000/api/v2/execute
SANDBOX_URL="https://emkc.org/api/v2/piston/execute"
SANDBOX_API_KEY=""

# ============================================================
# Proctoring & AI Video/Audio Service
# ============================================================
PROCTORING_SERVICE_WS_URL="ws://localhost:8000"
PROCTORING_MAX_WARNINGS=3
RISK_TERMINATION_THRESHOLD=100
HIGH_RISK_AUTO_TERMINATE=True

# --- Audio/Video Microservice Specific (.env for audi_video) ---
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY="your-openrouter-api-key"
# YOLO_CONFIDENCE=0.25
# ENABLE_GPU=false
# MAX_AUDIO_SIZE_MB=20
# WORKER_POOL_SIZE=4

# ============================================================
# Seed Credentials (Auto-created on fresh DB)
# ============================================================
SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD="AdminPassword123!"
SEED_HR_PASSWORD="HRPassword123!"

# ============================================================
# Feature Flags
# ============================================================
ENABLE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=False
```
